FlashInfer SM120 FP8 Prefill
Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights reserved.
SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
Source: https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer at commit
e44067b1fbfce66f547d48c41976b1a57366b8f8
Original path:
flashinfer/cute_dsl/attention/fmha/sm120/fmha_prefill_fp8_tma.py

The NVIDIA SM120 FP8 prefill implementation adapts the upstream kernel class
and body, including the TMA K/V pipeline, warp MMA, online softmax, scheduler,
and output epilogue. ATREX adaptations provide NHD paged-KV storage, runtime
[B,Hkv] descales, ATREX API integration, natural-log head-major LSE, and
invalid-tail handling. The adapted source retains the upstream BSD notice and
copyright attribution. The BSD-3-Clause terms for this component follow.

The upstream helper section bearing a separate NVIDIA proprietary notice is
excluded from the adapted module. Local PTX/CuTe helpers are maintained in
separately attributed ATREX sections alongside the kernel body. The exact
source revision and adaptation patch are retained as provenance; this notice
does not claim the retained kernel body
was independently authored by ATREX.

